-- Proc configuration for the mark
--   ProcFlags 20 = DONE_MELEE_AUTO_ATTACK (0x4) | DONE_SPELL_MELEE_DMG_CLASS
--   (0x10) -- the aura is on the enemy, so the enemy is the actor.
--   SpellPhaseMask MUST be 2; a row with 0 never fires and reports nothing.
--   Charges 3 is the "next three attacks" limit.
-- ============================================================
